le 1996 films\n\nLone Star (1996), where he portrayed killing suspected sheriff and in the film adaptation of\n\nJohn Grisham's novel\n\nA Time to Kill (1996), where he played an idealistic young lawyer opposite\n\nSandra Bullock and\n\n"
